  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Thermosetting polymer :A thermosetting polymer can be moulded into desired shape when hot, but once these get cooled and hardened, they cannot be remoulded again. An example of this is&nbsp;Bakelite.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"
